WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
MAIRO reads your results every day — what Meta reports, and the orders you confirm.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.000
When something is worth testing, it says what it noticed and why.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.200
With the evidence, the effect on your budget, and the risk.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.000
You decide. Approved — and nothing about your spend changed.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.700
Small, reversible changes can run on their own only if you allow it. The big ones always wait for you.
